      "title": "Diameter: Dissect User-Name as EAP NAI on STa, SWm, S6b, etc.",
      "message": "Diameter: Dissect User-Name as EAP NAI on STa, SWm, S6b, etc.\n\nPer 3GPP TS 29.273, on STa, SWm, S6b, SWa, and SWd when Command\nCode 268 (Diameter-EAP) is used, the User-Name AVP \"shall be represented\nin NAI form as specified in IETF RFC 4282 [15] and shall be formatted\nas defined in clause 19 of 3GPP TS 23.003 [14]. This IE shall include the\nleading digit used to differentiate between authentication schemes,\"\n\nDissect it as such. Note that on the those application IDs for other\ncommand codes, the User-Name AVP does *not* contain the leading digit.\n",
